              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.65.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 65:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man urudi bibedo karacelo ku nyathi rombo, man ng’u bivuto karacelo ku nyathi diel; man nyathi dhiang’ ku nyathin umvor man lim ma fulful de karacelo; e nyathin ma nyanok bipeyogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man min dhiang’ ku wai bicamu; man nyithindhgi bivuto karacelo, e umvor bicamu lum calu koni dhiang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nyathin ma dhoth bituko wi odpino, man nyathin m’ukwiro cak biketho cinge dhu odbunyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibitimo rac kadi nyotho de ngo kum got para ma leng’ ceke; kum ng’om bibedo pong’ ku ng’eyong’ec pa Yehova, calu pi umo ng’om.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
