        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 15:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia ulag Yese, m’ucungo ni abera ni kodhidhanu, thek biyenyo i bang’e; man kayom pare bibedo mi dwong’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia Rwoth biketho cinge kendo wang’ arionde kara egam dong’ dhanu pare, ma bidong’, kud i Ascur, man kud i Misiri, man kud i Pathroc, man kud i Kuc, man kud i Elam, man kud i Cinar, man kud i Hamath, man kud i cula mi nam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebiting’o abera ni thek, e ebicoko ju ma juriemo mir Israel, man ebicoko ju ma julalugi mi Yuda kud i tung’ ng’om ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyeko pa Efraim bende biai, man jubikabu ju m’usendo Yuda woko: nyeko binego Efraim ungo kum Yuda, man Yuda bisendo Efraim ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gibikonjri piny wi gok Jufilisti yo reto; e gibinyotho nyithindho ma yo nyangu karacelo: gibirieyo cing’gi wi Edom ku Moab; man nyithindho mir Amon biworogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 16:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova binyotho leb nam mi Misiri kot; man ebileko cinge wi Kulo ku yamu ma wang’, e ebigoye ebipokre ni kulo abiro, man ebiketho dhanu kadhe ku tielo ku wi ng’om m’uthwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gengi bibedo nuti ni dong’ dhanu pare, ma bidong’, m’uai Ascur; calu ma yang’ ebedo ni Israel i ceng’ m’eidho ie malu kud i ng’om Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
